# Benom's cube (GrandBossTeleporter): the above ground link of its page (onFirstTalk) sends the character to one
# of the two points above Benom's lair, up to 100 away from it on each axis (onAdvEvent benom_exit; every draw 1: the
# second point). The reference probe replays the trip.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/grand_boss_teleporter_benom_exit.golden
character Pilgrim 60
random always 1
script script.teleport.GrandBossTeleporter
page script/teleport/GrandBossTeleporter/
npc benom 29055 Folk 10 0 0

action benom
action benom
  S ActionFailed
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=benom item=0 page=script/teleport/GrandBossTeleporter/29055-01.htm
  S ActionFailed
bypass Quest GrandBossTeleporter benom_exit
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
  S TeleportToLocation obj=player loc=11918,-49447,-1088+-100 fast=0
  S DeleteObject obj=benom
